{title: Doxology (Praise God from Whom All Blessings Flow)}
{artist: Thomas Ken / Louis Bourgeois (Old Hundredth)}
{genre: Hymn}
{flow: Response, Closing}
{style: Traditional}
{key: G}
{tempo: 80}
{time: 4/4}
{hymnal: 새찬송가 1장}
{title_ko: 만복의 근원 하나님}
{score: doxology.abc}

{start_of_verse: Verse 1}
[G]Praise God, from [D]whom all [Em]blessings [C]flow
[G]Praise Him, all [D]creatures [Em]here be[D]low
[G]Praise Him a[C]bove, ye [G]heavenly [D]host
[G]Praise Father, [C]Son, and [G]Holy [D]Ghost. [G]A[C]men [G]
{end_of_verse}
